
	Dear all,


This package contains the following fixes/changes for the LTP part 
(under compile switch MPEG4V1) :

- reduced the LTP buffer size so that it contains only 3 past frames instead
  of 4. The maximum lag is still the same but the place of zero lag has been
  changed. Also the buffer update procedure has been corrected/clarified.

- syntax update (should be in line with the FDIS textual description).

- clean-up in file nok_pitch.c resulting in faster execution of LTP.


	Best Regards
		
		Juha

